    "title": "Arizona Triple Twist Winning Numbers and Legal Update",
    "text": "• The winning numbers in Wednesday's drawing of the 'Arizona Triple Twist' game were: 28, 30, 33, 34, 35, 41.\n• The numbers can also be expressed as: twenty-eight, thirty, thirty-three, thirty-four, thirty-five, forty-one.\n• The 9th Circuit Court of Appeals has allowed two individuals to sue the Arizona Department of Revenue.\n• The lawsuit claims the department violated due process rights by not adequately notifying individuals of unclaimed or abandoned property.\n• Arizona state law requires the Department of Revenue to maintain a website listing unclaimed property but does not mandate direct notification to property owners.\n• Weather report indicates a clear sky with a low of 84°F and winds from the SSE at 5 to 10 mph.\n• The forecast also predicts sunshine mixed with clouds, a high of 99°F, and winds from the SSE at 10 to 20 mph.",
